import LegalLayout from "../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  eyebrow="Privacy"
  description="How Pilot Journey plans to handle website enquiries, launch notifications and anonymous community statistics."
>
  <h2>1. Data collected</h2>
  <p>
    The website may collect an email address for launch notifications and the information you submit through the
    contact form. Purchase information is processed by Lemon Squeezy under its own privacy terms.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Community statistics</h2>
  <p>
    A future optional feature may count completed flights and passengers using an anonymous installation identifier.
    It is intended to contain aggregate counts, not a pilot name, account profile or flight route history. The desktop
    app will include an opt-out control before this feature is enabled.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Purpose and retention</h2>
  <p>
    Contact details are used to answer enquiries or send requested launch information. Final retention periods and
    deletion procedures will be published before these collection features go live.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    The site may use privacy-focused Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand aggregate page traffic without building
    advertising profiles.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Contact</h2>
  <p>Privacy questions and deletion requests can be sent to support@thepilotjourney.com.</p>
</LegalLayout>
